        output->data[input1->bytes / sizeof(TfLiteFloat32)] = input1->data[input1->bytes / sizeof(TfLiteFloat32)] / input2->data[input2->bytes / sizeof(TfLiteFloat32)];
    }
    // Add similar logic for other supported types (INT32, quantized UINT8)
}
```
* **Call Example:**
```cpp
